      "content": "idk if there even is a \"new path\" though. that's the thing. i've spent my whole life running toward this specific thing, and now that i'm here, the engine just stopped. it feels like i've run out of fuel. like the whole game is just... over. there's no more levels to unlock. i just feel so tired of trying to find meaning in things that clearly don't give it to me.",
